            <ArticleTitle>A case of pseudarthrosis of the capitate.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>137-40</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pseudarthrosis of the capitate bone is extremely rare. In this case, the injury and pseudarthrosis was so old, the bone with a nutrient vessel was grafted, and bone union and excellent results are obtained.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
